<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Sulzer.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Sulzer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Sulzer registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    750.00 SFR		PREMIUM	16.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     8.60 SFR		  GEARING	7.50 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.NOV.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	05.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  718.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
